# of the VRAM pool (the top ~170 MiB cannot be used), TGCU_BESTFIT=1 serves allocations from the smallest fitting free
# hole, TGCU_MEMINFO_FIXED_MIB (the constant cudaMemGetInfo subtracts for everything outside the chunks, default 1024),
# TGCU_MEMLOG, TGCU_SYNC_EACH, TGCU_WAIT_S, TGCU_HANG_DUMP=2 (stacks only; =1 probes the card on a hang and can hang the
# host); tgcu_api.py: the parameter decode printed on a GPU timeout.
# Base: patches/shim/base/ (the host-tail shim, git 25ae464) + the earlier shim patches; `git apply -p1` in a directory that holds shim/<file>.

